  "prefLabel": "Res 5601.06 Outdoor Grills and Stoves",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 5601.06 Outdoor Grills and Stoves. Charcoal fires in a container off the ground, gas grills and devices, and all controlled camp stoves shall not require a fire permit.\n\nSource. #8441, eff 10-1-05; ss by #10547, eff 3-21-14",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/res5200-5900.html"
